spai-camera-access-name = Internal Camera Bug
spai-camera-access-desc = Allows the SPAI to remotely connect to the station's surveillance camera network.

spai-security-hud-name = Advanced Security HUD
spai-security-hud-desc = Allows you to see and change statuses.

spai-security-records-name = Advanced Security Records
spai-security-records-desc = Grants access to security records, similar to the brig computers. You can change statuses, including execution status. Unlike the Advanced Security HUD, you can do this without being noticed.

spai-thermal-vision-name = Thermal Vision
spai-thermal-vision-desc = Allows the SPAI to see living objects through walls.

spai-chem-injector-name = Chemical Injector
spai-chem-injector-desc = Storage of 30 units of reagents. You can inject 5 units of Kelotane, Bicaridine, Epinephrine, Dexalin, Tricordrazine, Mannitol, or 15 units of Omnizine into your carrier. Storage refills by 5 units every 15 seconds.

spai-injector-window-title = Chemical Injector
spai-injector-window-energy = Energy: { $current } / { $max }
spai-injector-window-reagent-button = { $name } ({ $cost })

spai-weak-ai-name = Weakened AI Capability
spai-weak-ai-desc = Every 10 seconds you can interact with surrounding devices like an AI: open, bolt, electrify airlocks, set them to emergency access, and disable APCs.
